  "key_findings": [
    "Model, exact lookup and fixed 1NN achieved 100 percent written recovery in all 15 cases.",
    "Mean unseen-input model accuracy exceeded selection-chosen KNN on Wine, was nearly equal on Iris, and was lower on Digits.",
    "Only Digits without retained replay had smaller model deployment artifacts than exact and KNN; retaining replay removed this size advantage.",
    "Exact lookup abstained on genuinely unseen inputs as intended; this does not demonstrate a superior general memory system."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "There are three independent source datasets; the five seeds per dataset are repeated partitions and not fifteen independent domains.",
    "Digits is the sklearn 1797-row copy of the original UCI test subset, re-split by sample, without a writer-independent generalization guarantee.",
    "These tasks measure fixed-learner perceptual/semantic pattern classification and written-feature recovery, not episodic or general conversational memory.",
    "Deployment bytes exclude separately reported evaluation provenance, evaluation logs, runtime dependency binaries, and Python object overhead.",
    "The audit checks saved evidence consistency and does not independently reproduce training or prove scientific generality.",
    "No significance or independent-domain population guarantee is inferred from descriptive five-split ranges."
  ],
